description: |
  Maxim MAX30101 / MAX30102 pulse-oximetry front end, driven by the wearable
  app's own driver (src/drivers/max30101.cpp).

compatible: "wearable,max30101"

include: i2c-device.yaml

properties:
  int-gpios:
    type: phandle-array
    description: Open-drain interrupt output (active low, needs a pull-up).
